{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3Characters","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3Characters","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH2Wedderburn"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.character_iotaAlg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.character_iotaAlg","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L111-L118","doc":"**Character stabilization along the tower (sorry-free)**: the H₃\ncharacter restricts along `iotaAlg : H₂(q) →ₐ H₃(q)` to the H₂\ncharacter of `HeckeH2Wedderburn` at the same root. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.character_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.character_apply","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L108-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.character","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.character","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L94-L106","doc":"**The 1-dim Wedderburn-block character of H₃(q) (sorry-free).**\nAt a root `l` of the Hecke quadratic, `σ₀, σ₁ ↦ l` extends to the\nring homomorphism `H₃(q) → R`.  The two roots give the two\none-dimensional blocks — the partitions `(3)` and `(1,1,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_iota23","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_iota23","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L84-L88","doc":"The character restricts along the `H₂ ↪ H₃` inclusion to the rank-2\ncharacter: `χ_ℓ(ι(a·γ + b·σ₀)) = a + ℓ·b` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_mulNF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_mulNF","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L64-L82","doc":"**Multiplicativity of the character on the full NF product\n(sorry-free).**  Expand `mulNF` by right-linearity, then reduce each\nbasis-word action with the two intertwining lemmas. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_mulσ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_mulσ₁","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L57-L62","doc":"The character intertwines the right `σ₁`-action with multiplication\nby the root (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_mulσ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_mulσ₀","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L49-L55","doc":"The character intertwines the right `σ₀`-action with multiplication\nby the root: `χ_ℓ(σ₀ · u) = ℓ · χ_ℓ(u)` (sorry-free, given the root\nproperty). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_unitNF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF_unitNF","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L46-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.chiNF","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3Characters.lean#L41-L44","doc":"The **character functional** at `l` on NF coordinates: each basis\nword contributes `l ^ length`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}